# always-on

@CoOccurrenceGeometry is computed when the app starts and updated on every spec change. No cold start, no warm-up delay. The @RightHemisphere is attending from the moment the app opens.

Violation: the @user edits for some period before @ContrastSpace is built. Changes during that window go unattended.

